# Per-worktree agent role instructions (Dev-1/Dev-2/QA/…) — they differ per worktree, so they are
# intentionally LOCAL and never tracked; committing one path would clobber the others across git
# worktrees. This is the ONLY Markdown we ignore — KAN-97 dropped the former blanket `*.md` that also
# swept docs/adr (KAN-89/91), READMEs, CHANGELOG and server/** docs. All other *.md is now versioned.
